\n1. Import an animation with the \"-loop\" suffix added to it's name (Or open the example project..)\n2. Open the imported glb file as a scene. See that the animation loops in the animation player (as it should)\n3. Open the import settings for the glb file. See that the loop mode is not set.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[animloopbugproject.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21342562/animloopbugproject.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108823/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108823/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}